Feature: Checking battery and clientRects and font and other feature element fingerprinting responses   
    Scenario: Preliminary Firefox test results for an extension to change the battery and clientRects and font and navigator value
        When we view the Firefox page with some battery and clientRects and font and navigator values interference
        Then we have a Firefox page which ran the battery and clientRects and font and navigator response
        Then the Firefox battery and clientRects and font value has been recorded
        Then the Firefox navigator value has been recorded
        Then we will log the battery and clientRects and font and navigator testing time in the saved file
        # Then the Firefox battery and clientRects and font value is saved
        Then the Firefox battery value is saved
        Then the Firefox clientRects value is saved
        Then the Firefox font value is saved
        Then the Firefox navigator value is saved
        Then the visitor id for battery and clientRects and font and navigator is saved
    
